<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Markdown Style Reference — Example Journal</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=UnifrakturMaguntia&family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,400&family=Grenze:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&family=Quicksand:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================
   ROOT TOKENS
   ============================================ */
:root {
  --bg: #0D0B1A;
  --bg-panel: #1A1728;
  --bg-code: #12101C;
  --bg-glass: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.72);
  --text: #E8E4F0;
  --text-dim: #9B94A8;
  --text-faint: #5A5470;
  --text-nav: #B8B2C8;
  --hero-meta: #8B7AB8;
  --accent: #8B1A4A;
  --accent-bright: #B02A5A;
  --accent-gold: #C9A96E;
  --accent-purple: #4A3F6B;
  --border: rgba(74, 63, 107, 0.35);
  --border-soft: rgba(74, 63, 107, 0.15);

  --font-gothic: 'UnifrakturMaguntia', serif;
  --font-sharp: 'Cinzel', serif;
  --font-soft: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
  --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  --font-body: 'Grenze', 'Inter', sans-serif;
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;

  --ease-soft: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
button,
a,
.page-title,
.page-subtitle,
.markdown-body h1,
.markdown-body h2,
.markdown-body h3,
.markdown-body h4,
.markdown-body h5,
.markdown-body h6,
.markdown-body kbd,
.markdown-body summary,
.toc,
.toc *,
.callout-title,
.logo,
.section-indicator {
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  -moz-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-user-drag: none;
}
img,
svg {
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-user-drag: none;
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  position: relative;
  padding: 0 24px 120px;
}

/* 噪点纹理 */
body::after {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.85' numOctaves='4'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  opacity: 0.035;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 9998;
}

/* ============================================
   页面骨架
   ============================================ */
.page-header {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 80px 0 64px;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  margin-bottom: 80px;
}

.page-header h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-gothic);
  font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 72px);
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.2);
}

.page-header p {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.page-header .meta {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.3em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--hero-meta);
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.container {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* 章节分隔说明 */
.section-marker {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.35em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint);
  margin: 80px 0 0;
  padding-bottom: 8px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  text-align: center;
}

.section-marker:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
}

/* ============================================
   MARKDOWN RENDER STYLES
   ============================================ */

.markdown-body {
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  word-wrap: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 段落 ---------- */
.markdown-body p {
  margin: 0 0 1.6em;
}

.markdown-body p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

/* ---------- 标题 ---------- */
.markdown-body h1,
.markdown-body h2,
.markdown-body h3,
.markdown-body h4,
.markdown-body h5,
.markdown-body h6 {
  line-height: 1.25;
  scroll-margin-top: 100px;
}

.markdown-body h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-gothic);
  font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 52px);
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  margin: 64px 0 24px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.15);
}

.markdown-body h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-gothic);
  font-size: 40px;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  margin: 72px 0 24px;
}

.markdown-body h2::before {
  content: '❦';
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-right: 16px;
  font-size: 24px;
  vertical-align: middle;
  opacity: 0.65;
}

.markdown-body h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text);
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  margin: 48px 0 18px;
  padding-bottom: 10px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.22);
}

.markdown-body h3::before {
  content: '§ ';
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.markdown-body h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--accent-bright);
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  margin: 36px 0 14px;
}

.markdown-body h5 {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 28px 0 12px;
}

.markdown-body h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--text-faint);
  margin: 24px 0 10px;
}

/* ---------- 链接 ---------- */
.markdown-body a {
  color: var(--accent-bright);
  text-decoration: none;
  background-image: linear-gradient(var(--accent-bright), var(--accent-bright));
  background-size: 0% 1px;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-position: left bottom;
  transition: background-size 0.4s var(--ease-soft), color 0.3s;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
}

.markdown-body a:hover {
  background-size: 100% 1px;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
}

.markdown-body a[href^="http"]::after {
  content: '↗';
  font-size: 0.75em;
  margin-left: 3px;
  opacity: 0.6;
  vertical-align: super;
}

/* ---------- 强调 ---------- */
.markdown-body strong {
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.markdown-body em {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1.05em;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.markdown-body del {
  color: var(--text-faint);
  text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
}

.markdown-body mark {
  background: rgba(139, 26, 74, 0.28);
  color: var(--text);
  padding: 0 4px;
  border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ---------- 行内代码 ---------- */
.markdown-body code:not(pre code) {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.85em;
  background: rgba(74, 63, 107, 0.25);
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  padding: 0.15em 0.45em;
  border-radius: 3px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(74, 63, 107, 0.3);
}

/* ---------- 代码块 ---------- */
.markdown-body pre {
  margin: 32px 0;
  background: var(--bg-code);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  border-radius: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.markdown-body pre[data-language]::before {
  content: attr(data-language);
  display: block;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  background: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.85);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint);
}

.markdown-body pre code {
  display: block;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #C8C3D8;
  overflow-x: auto;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
}

.tok-kw { color: #B02A5A; font-weight: 500; }
.tok-str { color: #C9A96E; }
.tok-fn { color: #8B7AB8; }
.tok-cm { color: #5A5470; font-style: italic; }
.tok-num { color: #D4879F; }
.tok-prop { color: #7FB8B0; }
.tok-punct { color: #6B6480; }

/* ---------- 引用 ---------- */
.markdown-body blockquote {
  margin: 40px 0;
  padding: 24px 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139, 26, 74, 0.08), transparent);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  position: relative;
}

.markdown-body blockquote::before {
  content: '❝';
  position: absolute;
  top: -12px;
  left: 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 48px;
  color: var(--accent);
  opacity: 0.35;
  line-height: 1;
}

.markdown-body blockquote p:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.markdown-body blockquote blockquote {
  margin: 16px 0;
  border-left-color: var(--accent-purple);
  font-size: 20px;
}

/* ---------- 列表 ---------- */
.markdown-body ul,
.markdown-body ol {
  margin: 24px 0 32px;
  padding-left: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.markdown-body ul li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.markdown-body ul li::before {
  content: '✦';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 2px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 14px;
}

.markdown-body ol {
  counter-reset: ordered;
}

.markdown-body ol li {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  counter-increment: ordered;
}

.markdown-body ol li::before {
  content: counter(ordered, decimal-leading-zero);
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 2px;
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.markdown-body ul ul li::before {
  content: '◦';
  color: var(--accent-purple);
}

.markdown-body ul ul ul li::before {
  content: '·';
  color: var(--text-faint);
}

/* ---------- 任务列表 ---------- */
.markdown-body input[type="checkbox"] {
  appearance: none;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent-purple);
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  vertical-align: -3px;
  margin-right: 10px;
  position: relative;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}

.markdown-body input[type="checkbox"]:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent-gold);
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.3);
}

.markdown-body input[type="checkbox"]:checked {
  background: var(--accent);
  border-color: var(--accent);
}

.markdown-body input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after {
  content: '✓';
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  color: var(--text);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.markdown-body li.task-list-item {
  list-style: none;
  padding-left: 0;
}

.markdown-body li.task-list-item::before {
  display: none;
}

/* ---------- 表格 ---------- */
.markdown-body table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  margin: 32px 0;
  font-size: 17px;
}

.markdown-body thead {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.markdown-body th {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-align: left;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  background: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.8);
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  font-weight: 600;
}

.markdown-body td {
  padding: 14px 16px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.markdown-body tbody tr {
  transition: background 0.3s;
}

.markdown-body tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
  background: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.4);
}

.markdown-body tbody tr:hover {
  background: rgba(139, 26, 74, 0.08);
}

/* ---------- 分隔线 ---------- */
.markdown-body hr {
  border: none;
  height: 40px;
  margin: 56px 0;
  background: transparent;
  position: relative;
}

.markdown-body hr::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border), transparent);
}

.markdown-body hr::after {
  content: '❦';
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  background: var(--bg);
  padding: 0 16px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 18px;
  opacity: 0.7;
}

/* ---------- 图片 ---------- */
.markdown-body img {
  max-width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  display: block;
  margin: 32px auto;
}

.markdown-body figure {
  margin: 40px 0;
}

.markdown-body figure img {
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.markdown-body figcaption {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 14px;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

/* ---------- 键盘按键 ---------- */
.markdown-body kbd {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 0.8em;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-panel), var(--bg-code));
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-bottom-width: 2px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 2px 6px;
  color: var(--text);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}

/* ---------- 上标下标 ---------- */
.markdown-body sup,
.markdown-body sub {
  font-size: 0.75em;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  line-height: 0;
}

/* ---------- 脚注 ---------- */
.markdown-body .footnotes {
  margin-top: 72px;
  padding-top: 32px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--text-dim);
}

.markdown-body .footnotes::before {
  content: 'Footnotes';
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.25em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.markdown-body .footnotes ol li::before {
  color: var(--accent-purple);
}

/* ---------- Callout ---------- */
.markdown-body blockquote.callout {
  border-left-width: 3px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 17px;
  padding: 18px 24px 18px 56px;
  color: var(--text);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout::before {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 20px;
  top: 50%;
  left: 20px;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  line-height: 1;
  opacity: 1;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout .callout-title {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  display: block;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout p {
  margin: 0;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-note {
  border-left-color: var(--accent-purple);
  background: rgba(74, 63, 107, 0.1);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-note::before {
  content: 'ℹ';
  color: #8B7AB8;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-note .callout-title {
  color: #8B7AB8;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-tip {
  border-left-color: var(--accent-gold);
  background: rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.06);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-tip::before {
  content: '✦';
  color: var(--accent-gold);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-tip .callout-title {
  color: var(--accent-gold);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-warning {
  border-left-color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(139, 26, 74, 0.08);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-warning::before {
  content: '⚠';
  color: var(--accent-bright);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-warning .callout-title {
  color: var(--accent-bright);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-danger {
  border-left-color: #C42A2A;
  background: rgba(196, 42, 42, 0.12);
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-danger::before {
  content: '☠';
  color: #E03A3A;
}

.markdown-body blockquote.callout-danger .callout-title {
  color: #E03A3A;
}

/* ---------- 折叠块 ---------- */
.markdown-body details {
  margin: 24px 0;
  padding: 16px 20px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.4);
}

.markdown-body summary {
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 14px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  cursor: pointer;
  list-style: none;
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 20px;
  transition: color 0.3s;
}

.markdown-body summary::before {
  content: '▸';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.markdown-body details[open] summary::before {
  transform: rotate(90deg);
}

.markdown-body summary:hover {
  color: var(--accent-bright);
}

.markdown-body details[open] {
  padding-bottom: 20px;
}

.markdown-body details > *:not(summary) {
  margin-top: 16px;
}

/* ---------- 首字下沉 ---------- */
.markdown-body p.drop-cap::first-letter {
  font-family: var(--font-gothic);
  font-size: 4em;
  float: left;
  line-height: 0.85;
  margin: 6px 12px 0 0;
  color: var(--accent-gold);
  text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(201, 169, 110, 0.3);
}

/* ---------- 目录 ---------- */
.markdown-body nav.toc {
  background: rgba(26, 23, 40, 0.4);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-gold);
  border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  padding: 24px 28px;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.markdown-body nav.toc ol {
  list-style: none;
  counter-reset: toc;
  margin: 0;
}

.markdown-body nav.toc li {
  counter-increment: toc;
  padding: 5px 0;
  color: var(--text-dim);
  padding-left: 0;
}

.markdown-body nav.toc li::before {
  content: counter(toc, upper-roman) '.';
  color: var(--accent-purple);
  font-family: var(--font-sharp);
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-right: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  position: static;
  display: inline;
}

.markdown-body nav.toc a {
  color: var(--text-dim);
  text-decoration: none;
  background: none;
}

.markdown-body nav.toc a:hover {
  color: var(--accent-gold);
}

/* ---------- 响应式 ---------- */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  body { padding: 0 18px 80px; }
  .page-header { padding: 56px 0 40px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .markdown-body { font-size: 17px; }
  .markdown-body h2 { font-size: 30px; margin-top: 52px; }
  .markdown-body h3 { font-size: 19px; }
  .markdown-body blockquote { font-size: 18px; padding: 20px 24px; }
  .markdown-body table { font-size: 14px; }
  .markdown-body th, .markdown-body td { padding: 10px 12px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="page-header">
  <h1>Markdown Reference</h1>
  <p>Every element, rendered in the Example Journal style</p>
  <div class="meta">Type Specimen · MMXXVI</div>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <!-- ============================================
       块级元素
       ============================================ -->
  <div class="section-marker">Block Elements</div>
  <div class="markdown-body" style="margin-top: 48px;">

    <!-- 标题层级 -->
    <h1>Heading Level One</h1>
    <p>这是 H1 的样子，哥特字体，暗金色，带有一圈微微的光晕。通常用于文章的主标题。</p>

    <h2>Heading Level Two</h2>
    <p>H2 前面有一枚小鸢尾花装饰，用于主要章节。</p>

    <h3>Heading Level Three</h3>
    <p>H3 用 Cinzel，带暗金色下划线，用于小节。</p>

    <h4>Heading Level Four</h4>
    <p>H4 用暗红色，层级更低一档。</p>

    <h5>Heading Level Five</h5>
    <p>H5 用大写间距字母，比正文略小。</p>

    <h6>Heading Level Six</h6>
    <p>H6 用斜体，最轻的一级。</p>

    <hr>

    <!-- 段落与强调 -->
    <h2>Paragraphs &amp; Emphasis</h2>

    <p class="drop-cap">
      这是一段首字下沉的段落。Drop cap 让文章开头有了中世纪手抄本的味道，大写的
      <strong>UnifrakturMaguntia</strong> 字母从段落中浮起，带着暗金色的微光。这个效果
      适合用在长文的第一个段落上。
    </p>

    <p>
      普通段落用 <strong>Grenze</strong>，行高 1.9，段落间距 1.6em。
      你可以用 <strong>加粗</strong> 来强调重点，用 <em>斜体</em> 来表达语气，
      用 <del>删除线</del> 来表示作废，用 <mark>高亮标记</mark> 来突出关键句。
    </p>

    <p>
      行内代码像这样：<code>const exampleJournal = true</code>，
      键盘按键像这样：<kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>P</kbd>，
      上标<sup>[1]</sup> 和下标 H<sub>2</sub>O 也都有样式。
    </p>

    <p>
      链接默认是 <a href="#">暗红色</a>，悬停时下划线从左到右渐入，颜色变成
      <a href="#">暗金色</a>。外部链接会自动带一个 <a href="https://example.com">↗ 小箭头</a>。
    </p>

    <hr>

    <!-- 引用 -->
    <h2>Blockquote</h2>

    <blockquote>
      <p>字母不是形状，而是凝固在墨里的手势，一只手伸过几个世纪。</p>
    </blockquote>

    <p>引用块也可以嵌套，内层用紫色左线区分：</p>

    <blockquote>
      <p>外层引用。</p>
      <blockquote>
        <p>内层引用，颜色更深，字号略小。</p>
      </blockquote>
    </blockquote>

    <hr>

    <!-- 列表 -->
    <h2>Lists</h2>

    <h3>Unordered</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>第一项，用鸢尾花符号 ✦</li>
      <li>第二项，同样是暗红色标记
        <ul>
          <li>嵌套层级换成空心圆 ◦</li>
          <li>再深一层换成实心点 ·</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>第三项</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Ordered</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>第一项，用暗金色两位数字编号</li>
      <li>第二项
        <ol>
          <li>嵌套有序列表继承样式</li>
          <li>编号会自动递增</li>
        </ol>
      </li>
      <li>第三项</li>
    </ol>

    <h3>Task List</h3>
    <ul>
      <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" checked> 已完成的任务</li>
      <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox"> 未完成的任务</li>
      <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" checked> 勾选后变成暗红底</li>
      <li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox"> 悬停时有金色微光</li>
    </ul>

    <hr>

    <!-- 代码块 -->
    <h2>Code Blocks</h2>

    <p>代码块顶部有语言标签，背景比页面深一档，形成凹陷感：</p>

    <pre data-language="typescript"><code><span class="tok-cm">// 定义哥特主题的 token</span>
<span class="tok-kw">const</span> <span class="tok-fn">theme</span> <span class="tok-punct">=</span> <span class="tok-punct">&#123;</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">background</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span> <span class="tok-str">'#0D0B1A'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">surface</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>    <span class="tok-str">'#1A1728'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">primary</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>    <span class="tok-str">'#8B1A4A'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">accent</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>     <span class="tok-str">'#C9A96E'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">text</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>       <span class="tok-str">'#E8E4F0'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">muted</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>      <span class="tok-str">'#9B94A8'</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">radius</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span>     <span class="tok-num">6</span><span class="tok-punct">,</span>
<span class="tok-punct">&#125;</span> <span class="tok-kw">as const</span><span class="tok-punct">;</span>
</code></pre>

    <pre data-language="css"><code><span class="tok-cm">/* 哥特暗色的核心变量 */</span>
<span class="tok-fn">:root</span> <span class="tok-punct">&#123;</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">--bg</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span> <span class="tok-str">#0D0B1A</span><span class="tok-punct">;</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">--accent</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span> <span class="tok-str">#8B1A4A</span><span class="tok-punct">;</span>
  <span class="tok-prop">--gold</span><span class="tok-punct">:</span> <span class="tok-str">#C9A96E</span><span class="tok-punct">;</span>
<span class="tok-punct">&#125;</span>
</code></pre>

    <hr>

    <!-- Callout -->
    <h2>Callouts</h2>

    <blockquote class="callout callout-note">
      <span class="callout-title">Note</span>
      <p>这是 Note 类型的提示框，暗紫色调，带一个信息图标。</p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote class="callout callout-tip">
      <span class="callout-title">Tip</span>
      <p>这是 Tip 类型的提示框，暗金色调，带一个星形图标。</p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote class="callout callout-warning">
      <span class="callout-title">Warning</span>
      <p>这是 Warning 类型的提示框，暗红色调，带一个警告图标。</p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote class="callout callout-danger">
      <span class="callout-title">Danger</span>
      <p>这是 Danger 类型的提示框，更深的红色，带一个骷髅图标。</p>
    </blockquote>

    <hr>

    <!-- 表格 -->
    <h2>Table</h2>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Role</th>
          <th>Typeface</th>
          <th>Usage</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Gothic Display</td>
          <td>UnifrakturMaguntia</td>
          <td>Titles, logo, H1/H2</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Sharp / Carved</td>
          <td>Cinzel</td>
          <td>Nav, labels, metadata</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
